@startuml Deployment_Sequence
title Deployment Sequence - Host → Jenkins → Flutter Container

actor Developer
participant "Host (WSL2/Linux)" as Host
participant "Jenkins Container" as Jenkins
participant "Flutter Build Container\n(flutter_rust_env)" as Build

Developer -> Host : docker compose up
Host -> Jenkins : Start Jenkins container

Developer -> Jenkins : Trigger Pipeline Job
Jenkins -> Jenkins : cleanWs()

Jenkins -> Build : docker run flutter_rust_env\n(bind mount workspace + cache)

Build -> Build : Setup Environment\nValidate mounts\nSelf-test

Build -> Build : git clone into git_checkout/

Build -> Build : cargo ndk build\n(Rust FFI → JNI .so)
Build -> Build : flutter build apk/aab

Build -> Jenkins : Copy artifacts → workspace/artifacts/

Jenkins -> Jenkins : archiveArtifacts()

Jenkins -> Developer : Build Result (Success/Failure)

@enduml